CHAB/SPACE CARDIAC DIGITAL TWIN STUDY
COMPUTATIONAL ARTIFACT REGISTRY
Repository path: 09_Computational_Reproducibility/

Purpose
-------
This registry provides the controlled inventory of computational artifacts
associated with the patient-specific cardiac digital-twin study.

Repository policy
-----------------
Only artifacts that are demonstrably derived from the study workflow,
supported by the available source environment, or explicitly identified as
design/documentation artifacts are retained as repository evidence.

Prespecified simulation design
------------------------------
Cohort: 5 patient-specific cardiac models
Simulation conditions: 30
Design: 5 patients × 6 gravity levels
Gravity levels: 1.00, 0.75, 0.50, 0.38, 0.16, 0.00 G

