Important exclusion
-------------------
Candidate numerical values, illustrative solver logs, hypothetical FEM
field values, placeholder hashes, and assumed hardware configurations are
not treated as executed study results and must not be represented as such
in the public repository or manuscript.

Current reproducibility state
-----------------------------
The repository documents the computational design, provenance,
methodological specification, evidence-recovery status, and reconciliation
workflow. It does not claim complete native-model reproducibility unless
the underlying source model and corresponding executed outputs are
independently verified and available.



    





   
    

    
    


